![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

In `getV1CurrentTopicArtifacts`, if an artifact has neither `topicId` nor `topic` defined, `getPaperWorkspaceTopicSlug(undefined)` will fall back to returning `CANONICAL_PR4_TOPIC_ID` (`'integration-techniques'`). If the requested `profile.topicId` is also `'integration-techniques'`, this artifact will be incorrectly matched and filtered into the integration techniques topic. We should guard this check to ensure that only artifacts with valid topic information are matched.

```javascript
function getV1CurrentTopicArtifacts(artifacts, topicIdOrTitle = 'integration-techniques') {
  const profile = getV1PaperWorkspaceTopicProfile(topicIdOrTitle);
  return artifacts.filter((artifact) => {
    const topicVal = artifact.topicId ?? artifact.topic;
    return (topicVal ? getPaperWorkspaceTopicSlug(topicVal) === profile.topicId : false)
      || artifact.topic === profile.title;
  });
}
```

