![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

In `useV1TopicDetail`, if a task has none of `topicId`, `topic`, or `targetTopic` defined, `getPaperWorkspaceTopicSlug(undefined)` will fall back to returning `CANONICAL_PR4_TOPIC_ID` (`'integration-techniques'`). If the requested `topicProfile.topicId` is also `'integration-techniques'`, this task will be incorrectly matched and filtered into the integration techniques topic. We should guard this check to ensure that only tasks with valid topic information are matched.

```suggestion
    const topicTasks = tasks.filter((task) => {
      const taskTopicVal = task.topicId ?? task.topic ?? task.targetTopic;
      return (taskTopicVal ? getPaperWorkspaceTopicSlug(taskTopicVal) === topicProfile.topicId : false)
        || task.topic === topicProfile.title
        || task.targetTopic === topicProfile.title;
    });
```
